# Suppressions for the `ffi_safety_tests` valgrind run.
#
# Only leaks that are known, tracked and outside `c-bindings` belong here: the
# point of the run is that anything else definitely lost fails the job.

# The circom-generated witness calculators leak a small `new[]` block on every
# call: 12 bytes per leader proof, 128 bytes per ZK signature.
{
   circom_pol_witness_leak
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite
   ...
   fun:pol_generate_witness
}
{
   circom_signature_witness_leak
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite
   ...
   fun:signature_generate_witness
}
